{
  "info": {
    "name": "TubeCP API",
    "description": "All API routes for the TubeCP (youtube-mcp-agent) application.\n\n## Auth setup (required for protected routes)\n\nWithout auth you will get `401 {\"error\":\"Sign in required\",\"code\":\"AUTH_REQUIRED\"}`.\n\n**Option A — Auth.js session cookie (recommended):**\n1. Sign in at {{base_url}}/sign-in in your browser\n2. Open DevTools → Application → Cookies → localhost\n3. Copy the full `authjs.session-token` cookie (name=value)\n4. Paste it into the `session_cookie` collection variable\n5. Keep the Cookie header enabled, keep x-e2e-user-id disabled\n\n**Option B — E2E bypass (local dev only):**\n1. Add `E2E_AUTH_BYPASS=true` to your `.env` file\n2. Restart `npm run dev`\n3. Disable the Cookie header on requests\n4. Enable the `x-e2e-user-id` header (exact name — not x-e2e-user)\n5. Set `e2e_user_id` (default: test_user_123)\n\n## Typical flows\n\n**Research:** Expand → Search → Analyze (per video) → Rank\n**Knowledge base:** Create → Index Video (per video) → Finalize → Chat",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "session_cookie",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "e2e_user_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "kb_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "topic",
      "value": "AI SaaS monetization"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Public",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            },
            "description": "No auth required. Returns service status and configured integrations."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Polar Webhook",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/webhook/polar",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "webhook", "polar"]
            },
            "description": "Called by Polar.sh — not for manual use. Requires valid Polar webhook signature."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User & Billing",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Subscription",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Cookie",
                "value": "__session={{session_cookie}}",
                "disabled": false
              },
              {
                "key": "x-e2e-user-id",
                "value": "{{e2e_user_id}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/user/subscription",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "user", "subscription"]
            },
            "description": "Returns plan, limits, usage, and available plans for the signed-in user."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Checkout — Pro",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Cookie",
                "value": "__session={{session_cookie}}",
                "disabled": false
              },
              {
                "key": "x-e2e-user-id",
                "value": "{{e2e_user_id}}",
                "disabled": true
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/checkout?plan=pro",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "checkout"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "plan",
                  "value": "pro"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Redirects to Polar checkout for the Pro plan."
          },
          "response": []
